# No local Supabase worker (Hobby egress)

Daily `npm run dev` / `npm run worker` must use Docker Postgres (`localhost:5434`).

Do **not** set `CS_ALLOW_SUPABASE_WORKER=1` for routine work. That flag is a **one-shot** override to touch prod Supabase (migrate, re-atomize). Unset it when the command finishes.

Worker code already refuses Supabase unless the flag is set. Do not weaken that guard.
